  "reason": "RNA-only multiprofile PCA with avgpool is the strongest completed result (0.591 acc, 0.573 F1), while image-only ResNet multiprofile avgpool is weak (0.328 acc, 0.288 F1). The key uncertainty is whether the image modality adds complementary signal under the best profile/aggregation setting. config_018 tests the simplest multimodal extension by adding concat fusion with the same PCA RNA, ResNet image, multiprofile, and avgpool settings, isolating the effect of fusion without changing representation, profile, or aggregation. This is the best next budget use because it exploits the strongest RNA baseline and determines whether further investment in image/fusion is justified before testing more complex encoders or fusion variants."
